description	"Davik Kang

The feared head of the Exchange on Taris. A master of logistics and hired muscle, Davik fights through his extensive network of enforcers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Exchange Heavy Pistol
-- Pistol 3, 5% More Damage And RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Thermal Grenades (5)

^8Attributes:
- Personal Shield
- Healing (1)
- Personal Exchange Guard (Round Spawner)
- Blast Armor
- Rally
- Exchange Network (Tracking Beacon)
- Medpack
- Anti MT (1)
- Personal Shield 

^8Abilities:
- Call Backup (Support Beacon Exchange Bounty Hunter) ^3[CS1]
- Exchange Suit Scanner (Enemy Scanner ^3[CS2]
- Vambrace Micro Rockets (Whistling Birds) ^3[CS3]
- Tracking Darts (6) ^3[CS4]"
